About this XML document
This XML document provides a list of all weekly reports published on the Safety Gate portal from 2005 to the present. A new weekly report is published every Friday.
Each report contains a collection of product safety alerts issued during the respective week.
The information provided in each alert includes:
1. Product identification details (e.g. brand, model, barcode, photos, detailed product description
2. The type of risk or hazard associated with the product
3. Measures taken by companies or market surveillance authorities
4. The applicable legal basis for the action taken
To access the full content of a specific weekly report, copy the corresponding URL from the list and paste it into your browser.
Please note: Some fields within the reports are optional. Where information is missing, you may see 'xsi:nil="true"' indicating that the field was not completed.
